{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4afYmYsFxhm1T64xzj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient wooden door stands before you, its grain weathered by countless seasons. A single iron keyhole glows faintly.*\n\n*You insert the key.*\n\n*CLICK.*\n\n*The mechanism turns — tumblers falling like distant thunder — and the door swings inward on groaning hinges, revealing...*\n\n*A corridor of impossible length, lit by candles that burn without flame, their light the color of forgotten memories. The air tastes of old paper and rain. On the threshold, carved into the stone beneath your feet, a single word:*\n\n**FURTHER**\n\n*The door holds itself open. Waiting. Patient as stone. It will not close until you choose — forward, or back.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":158,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}